[statement]
A package installed for its own name answers, through a name it provides
at no version, an entry admitting earlier versions, though it states no
priority: `a` is requested, and answers `app`'s `v<3`.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
p:v

P:app
V:1
D:v<3

[request]
a
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 1
install app 1
